    "Done": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Double-click a book to edit it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本をダブルクリックすると編集できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Double-click to enter the details by hand; the book isn't exported until then.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ダブルクリックして詳細を手入力してください。入力するまで、この本は書き出されません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dutch": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "オランダ語"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Edit": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "編集"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "編集…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ElmLibrary Premium required": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ElmLibraryのプレミアム版が必要です"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ElmScanner": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ElmScanner"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ElmScanner Help": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ElmScanner ヘルプ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ElmScanner asks for your email address once, because Open Library asks every app to send one. Change it in Settings (⌘,).": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Libraryがすべてのアプリにメールアドレスの送信を求めているため、ElmScannerは最初に一度だけメールアドレスをおたずねします。変更は「設定」（⌘,）で行えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ElmScanner export: %@, %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ElmScannerの書き出し：%@、%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ElmScanner is free and open source, and every feature works without a tip. If you find it useful, you can leave a one-time tip to support its development. The purchase is handled by Apple.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ElmScannerは無料のオープンソースで、すべての機能をチップなしでお使いいただけます。お役に立てたら、開発を支援する1回限りのチップをお願いできます。購入手続きはAppleが行います。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ElmScanner is free and open source, and every feature works without a tip. If you find it useful, you can send a tip of about %@ (one coffee!) with PayPal to support its development.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ElmScannerは無料のオープンソースで、すべての機能をチップなしでお使いいただけます。お役に立てたら、開発を支援するため、PayPalで%@ほど（コーヒー1杯分！）のチップを送っていただけます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ElmScanner is open source under the MIT license.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ElmScannerはMITライセンスのオープンソースです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ElmScanner lets you quickly add books to Zotero and other reference management software by scanning bar codes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ElmScannerは、バーコードをスキャンするだけで、Zoteroなどの文献管理ソフトに本をすばやく追加できるアプリです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ElmScanner looks books up at Open Library and the National Diet Library, which cover English and Japanese books best. For other languages, enter the details by hand.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ElmScannerはOpen Libraryと国立国会図書館で本を検索します。どちらも英語と日本語の本に最も強く対応しています。それ以外の言語の本は、詳細を手入力してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ElmScanner looks up books on Open Library, a free service run by the Internet Archive. Open Library asks every app to include an email address, so that it can tell who is using its service and reach them if something goes wrong.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ElmScannerは、Internet Archiveが運営する無料サービス「Open Library」で本を検索します。Open Libraryは、利用者を把握し、問題が起きたときに連絡できるよう、すべてのアプリにメールアドレスを含めることを求めています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Email": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "メール"
